  "syntax rules": [
    "rule 1: Messages follow the structure [Action/State] [Entity/Location] [Optional: Item/Detail].",
    "rule 2: Codewords are space-separated single tokens.",
    "rule 3: Each object and container codeword maps to a unique entity ID; generic name-based tokens are forbidden.",
    "rule 4: Room IDs are mapped to unique indexed tokens (R1-R6) to distinguish multiple rooms of the same type.",
    "rule 5: To report multiple items (e.g., found or remaining), list the item tokens sequentially after the action token."
